Author: Seth Junot <xsetech@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Feb 20 04:53:37 2026 -0800

    feat: add MPS implementation of put_

    Implement put_mps_ for the MPS backend, fixing the remaining
    TestScalarTensorMPS failure after the take fix.

    The MPS implementation flattens self to 1D and uses index_put_ with
    linear indices to write source values at the specified positions,
    handling the non-contiguous case by copying back after the operation.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

